---
const title = "Mas'uliyatli O'yin (18+) — Aviator Uzbek";
const description = "Qimor o'yinlariga qaramlikning oldini olish, 18+ yosh chegarasi va Aviator o'yinida xavfsiz o'ynash qoidalari.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="uz" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/ru-otvetstvennaya-igra" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: #090d16;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 16px;
    }
    .nav-back {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .card {
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .card p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .badge-18 {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      color: #f87171;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #475569;
      padding: 16px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="container">
    <a href="/" class="nav-back">← Asosiy sahifaga qaytish</a>
    <span class="badge-18">🔞 18+ Yosh chegarasi</span>
    <h1>Mas'uliyatli O'yin Qoidalari</h1>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>1. Voyaga yetganlik talabi</h2>
      <p>
        Saytda taqdim etilgan barcha axborotlar faqat 18 yoshga to'lgan shaxslar uchun mo'ljallangan. Voyaga yetmaganlarning qimor o'yinlarida ishtirok etishi qat'iyan taqiqlanadi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>2. Qimor o'yini — daromad manbai emas</h2>
      <p>
        Aviator va boshqa qimor o'yinlari faqat ko'ngilochar vosita hisoblanadi. Hech qachon o'yinni asosiy yoki qo'shimcha daromad topish usuli sifatida qabul qilmang.
      </p>
      <p>
        Yo'qotilishi sizning moddiy yoki oilaviy farovonligingizga ta'sir qilmaydigan mablag' bilan o'ynang.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>3. Moliyaviy nazorat va cheklovlar</h2>
      <p>
        O'yinni boshlashdan oldin aniq byudjet va vaqt chegarasini belgilang. Agar o'yin hayotingizga, ishingizga yoki munosabatlaringizga salbiy ta'sir ko'rsatayotganini sezsangiz, darhol to'xtating va mutaxassislarga murojaat qiling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Aviator Uzbek. 18+ Mas'uliyat bilan o'ynang.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
